---
import Heading from "../ui/Heading.astro";
import Section from "../ui/Section.astro";
import Text from "../ui/Text.astro";
---

<div class="border-t border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)]">
	<Section id="why-cs3c" spacing="md">
		<div
			class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-20"
		>
			<div>
				<Text
					size="sm"
					tone="accent"
					weight="semibold"
					class="uppercase tracking-[0.16em]"
				>
					WHY CS3C EXISTS
				</Text>
				<Heading level={2} size="md" class="mt-5 max-w-xl">
					Cybersecurity knowledge is abundant. Structured engineering knowledge
					is not.
				</Heading>
			</div>

			<div class="max-w-2xl lg:pt-11">
				<Text size="lg">
					Frameworks, standards, reports, tools, and organizational experience
					continue to grow.
				</Text>
				<Text size="lg" class="mt-6">
					What remains difficult is transforming that knowledge into a coherent
					engineering system that can be understood, applied, improved, and
					reused.
				</Text>
				<Text size="lg" tone="accent" weight="medium" class="mt-6">
					CS3C exists to bridge that gap.
				</Text>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>
</div>
